      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，提出假设"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}↵=\\frac{n}{2n+1}$.　　　　　　　（2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用数学归纳法证明等式（2）成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用$A(n)$表示关于自然数$n$的等式（2）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. $A(1)$成立，因为$S_1=\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{1}{2\\times1+1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 我们来证明$A(k)\\Longrightarrow A(k+1)$："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$S_{k+1}=S_k+\\frac{1}{(2k+1)(2k+3)}=\\frac{k}{2k+1}+\\frac{1}{(2k+1)(2k+3)}↵=\\frac{k(2k+3)+1}{(2k+1)(2k+3)}=\\frac{(k+1)(2k+1)}{(2k+1)(2k+3)}↵=\\frac{k+1}{2(k+1)+1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数学归纳法证明的两部分已完成，就是说，等式（2）证毕，",
        "于是"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{1}{1\\times3}+\\frac{1}{3\\times5}+\\frac{1}{5\\times7}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}=\\frac{n}{2n+1}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于任意自然数$n$都成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2. 求证：对于任意自然数$n$，表达式$n^3+5n$的值可",
        "以被$6$整除."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用$A(n)$表示命题：“$x_n=n^3+5n$可以被$6$整除”."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$x_1=1+5=6$，所以当$n=1$时$x_n$可以被$6$整除，即",
        "$A(1)$成立. 我们来证明：$A(k)\\Longrightarrow A(k+1)$，即由“$x_k$可以被",
        "$6$整除”，可以推出“$x_{k+1}$可以被$6$整除”."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "· 7 ·"
      ]
    }
  ]
